drops { item: "green_mushroom_cap" per_kill: 0.4 }
description: "A Green Mushroom monster with a dull cap. It's a mutated form of small poisonous mushrooms and is thus immune to poison. No matter how hungry you are, do not eat them under any circumstance!"
